00:29:21.175 --> 00:29:23.650
You can go through this exercise

00:29:23.650 --> 00:29:26.440
on your own whether you're an undergraduate or graduate student,

00:29:26.440 --> 00:29:31.510
post-doc, or someone who's on the job market now through networking.

