00:30:05.185 --> 00:30:10.645
That is all through talking with people who are actively in the field now.

00:30:10.645 --> 00:30:13.585
You can do that through LinkedIn,

00:30:13.585 --> 00:30:18.280
you can do that through scientific societies, professional associations.

00:30:18.280 --> 00:30:21.055
You can do that in many different ways.

00:30:21.055 --> 00:30:26.500
I know that Yale actually has a very robust alumni database.

00:30:26.500 --> 00:30:31.734
You can get in touch with people who are working in quantum science now

00:30:31.734 --> 00:30:37.900
through possibly your institutions' alumni office or the Career Center.

00:30:37.900 --> 00:30:42.400
There are many different ways that you can start to get into the field,

00:30:42.400 --> 00:30:47.410
make contacts in the field even before applying for jobs.

00:30:47.410 --> 00:30:52.780
You can be online and you can be looking at job postings and you can be applying.

00:30:52.780 --> 00:30:54.220
Oh, that's great, Zlatko.

00:30:54.220 --> 00:30:55.975
That's excellent.

00:30:55.975 --> 00:31:01.015
Zlatko mentioned at my chat that he's on the Yale alumni database.

00:31:01.015 --> 00:31:06.490
It's important and someone on the call who has already connected with me on LinkedIn,

00:31:06.490 --> 00:31:09.340
you connect with any of us then you'll be

00:31:09.340 --> 00:31:13.450
connected or be able to see all of our connections.

00:31:13.450 --> 00:31:16.735
It's important for you to start building out your web of

00:31:16.735 --> 00:31:19.975
contacts because that will help you.

00:31:19.975 --> 00:31:24.805
Once you do see a posting that is interesting to you in your field,

00:31:24.805 --> 00:31:28.330
you can start to apply online.

00:31:28.330 --> 00:31:31.210
There's nothing wrong with applying online first,

00:31:31.210 --> 00:31:36.160
there's no harm in it it's free but the chances that you'll be called back

00:31:36.160 --> 00:31:41.680
are so much more likely if you have any connection at all with any person,

00:31:41.680 --> 00:31:44.020
any scientist, anyone who is connected to

00:31:44.020 --> 00:31:49.040
that organization so networking is the key I think.

